     2136         end.
     2137         for each buf_temp-browse-handle
     2138           where buf_temp-browse-handle.browse-type = 'width':u
     2139         on error undo move_block, retry move_block
     2140         :
     2141           assign
     2142             buf_temp-browse-handle.browse-handle :width
